Package: mrps-telemetry
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: nodejs (>= 18)
Recommends: smartmontools, wireguard-tools, lm-sensors, pciutils
Maintainer: Mani Ratan Pratap Singh <email@mrps.in>
Homepage: https://mrps.in
Description: MRPS live server telemetry API and dashboard
 A read-only Linux telemetry collector, HTTP API and Liquid Glass web
 dashboard, packaged as one service and one process.
 .
 The API samples CPU, memory, GPU, thermal, storage, SMART, disk, network,
 processes, WireGuard and Tailscale data once per second and exposes it over
 GET-only JSON endpoints plus a Server-Sent Events stream.
 .
 The dashboard is served from the same host and proxies the API on the same
 origin, so no CORS or mixed-content configuration is required.
